Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.73,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,This is such a drag,\Nfirst thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:06.19,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,What a brat! Stop complaining \Nand get to work, Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.46,0:00:08.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,That's that chick from the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.98,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I think her name was "Meguru."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:12.03,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Who's the other kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.66,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,He must be another Prime Right owner...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.43,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Whaddya think, Raion?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.79,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Should we attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:21.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,No, it'd be best if we can gather \Ninformation without taking them head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:24.00,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,We'll listen in on their conversation for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.75,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I don't want them messing \Nwith Sane's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:30.59,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,If they make their way inside \Nthe tower, we're attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.47,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:33.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:50.49,Show Title,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(320,110)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.76,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Jeez! It's so tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.49,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Hey, you said you went to the top, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.49,0:02:14.28,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Can't you teleport there \Nwith your Exchange Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:16.82,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,It's way too far from down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.44,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Exchange Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:20.46,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,So that's Meguru's Prime Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:25.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Judging from what they just said, \Nthere must be other conditions to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.84,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Aw man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:30.59,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,We can't get in 'cause of the rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.59,0:02:33.52,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Ikusa blew a hole in it before. \NIt piled up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.65,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,So annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:37.28,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Oh well. Knight, it's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.23,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Raion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:38.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.54,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,If I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.22,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Prime Right of—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:47.90,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.39,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:57.63,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Mommy! I-I-I-I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.63,0:02:59.52,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,It's the guy from KHN!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.37,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You'll have to deal with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:06.36,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the Rejection Right kid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:08.72,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Kisaragi warned me about his tactic:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:11.62,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}using the Response Right \Nfollowed by the Rejection Right...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:15.13,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all the information I need \Nto deal with you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.72,0:03:19.81,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must have forgotten my Prime Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.97,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll make sure you take \Neach other down this time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:22.97,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Prime Right of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:24.23,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:26.69,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,It's not working?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:29.86,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:35.33,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You're already under the command \Nof my Prime Right of Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:37.07,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,Control?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.07,0:03:39.13,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Once I activate my Control Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:42.16,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,all those within my reach will \Nlose their Prime Right abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.90,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,And unless I release my control,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:49.29,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,anyone I touch who tries \Nto use their Rights will... die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:50.97,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}It adds up...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.97,0:03:54.45,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had no problem using my Exchange Right \Nbefore I came to Hibiya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:55.52,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}But now...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.57,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Rejection Right hasn't \Neven been used on me, yet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:04:01.30,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was the Control Right... \NI'm in trouble!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:05.31,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course I'm lying, you idiot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:09.17,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The reason you can't use your Exchange \NRight is the Rejection Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:14.36,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once the Rejection Right is activated, \Nthe effects last for 72 hours.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:14.36,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\pos(320,40)\c&H393D3A&\3c&H393D3A&\3a&HBA&}72 Hours{\3c&H393D3A&\3a&H93&}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:17.63,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's only been two and a half days \Nsince our last battle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:21.32,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means the Rejection Right \Nstill stands for now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:27.29,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}All I needed to do was inform her \Nthat she can't use the Exchange Right,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:30.84,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}and this little act about my so-called \N"Control Right" gets eaten right up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:34.12,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I even tacked on a restriction by \Nthreatening death if she uses her Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:36.92,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}A perfect plan to neutralize Meguru's powers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:40.97,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,All that's left is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:44.19,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Hey, you! That was scary as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.90,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,What was that for?! Stop it, will ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.90,0:04:47.65,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Man, you're really just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:49.69,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Fine, then hurry up and scram home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:52.37,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Just to get yelled at by the hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.22,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:55.64,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,"Hag"? You mean the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.07,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} how you guys treat your Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.62,0:05:00.53,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,It's the death sentence for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.47,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What the—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.20,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\pos(320,40)\c&H4A4D4A&\3c&H393D3A&\3a&HBA&}Destruction Right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.20,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.66,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Go ahead and beat me if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:09.72,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Destruction?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:13.00,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,What kind of pure violence \Nis that for a Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.36,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Destruction Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:16.67,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You think Ryuta will be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:23.39,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ryuta-kun is even stronger now \Nthanks to his training in Tohoku, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:26.91,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Fusion Right is the power \Nto uniquely control fusion,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.18,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}reconstruction, and separation...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:30.52,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}If he fuses with a building,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:34.00,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}that building becomes a part \Nof his body for his full control.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:38.72,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}He can even fuse with the ground to control \Nthe earth, at least within a certain scope.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.57,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's exactly \Nwhy it would lose all power{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:44.40,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}if substances themselves \Nget physically destroyed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.89,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Destruction Right versus Fusion Right...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:49.00,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,{\i1}There couldn't be a worse match!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:51.50,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Fuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.88,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,He fused with the ground \Nto take away his footing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:57.62,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:06:00.34,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You can't physically destroy\N anything if you're free falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.47,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.01,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Right of... Flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.01,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\pos(320,40)\c&H4A4D4A&\3c&H393D3A&\3a&HBA&}Flight Right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:07.94,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,He flew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:09.14,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Thought you got me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:10.85,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:17.47,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Aww, don't you have a comeback like before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:19.36,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:22.92,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Looks like Ryuta's figured out \Nthe bad match-up...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:24.95,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,If we could at least catch the kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:29.91,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,There's no point in restraining him \Nwithout taking away his Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.75,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was able to stop Meguru by bluffing, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:37.10,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}I might blow my cover about \Nthe Control Right if I get involved...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.30,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe if we used the Rejection Right...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.45,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, that won't work!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:42.43,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it... Think!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's gotta be a way!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.32,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,If you won't make a move, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:52.68,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,I'll destroy everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.32,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:56.28,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Crap! I can't dodge all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.31,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Ryuta-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:04.40,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:07.19,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Gotcha! Nailed every blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.19,0:07:11.37,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I didn't expect the Queen \Nto recruit children, of all people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:16.42,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:19.49,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now, what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:21.73,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Time for this kid to learn a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.88,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,This is quite the trouble already...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.41,0:07:26.47,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Prime Right of Obtainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.30,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Prime Right of...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:30.90,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Induction!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.13,Default,Knight,0,0,0,,Destruction Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:38.68,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Hmm... A new application \Nof the Destruction Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.44,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Interesting. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:46.31,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,It stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:48.32,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I used my Suspension Right on the rock
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:53.26,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,to suspend time within a\None-meter radius when it crumbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.58,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.40,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:58.37,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,They won in no time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:02.68,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yagi-chan! Sudocchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:04.07,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,But why?! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:06.50,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I have no clue how this is possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.68,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,And besides... besides!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.41,Default,Ryuta/Omi,0,0,0,,Ippy-hiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:15.60,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Knight lost...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:19.04,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I can't use my Prime Right anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.26,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Does that woman over there serve the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:24.88,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:26.15,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.99,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Okay then, you can take \Nthat child and go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:30.93,Default,Meguru,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.85,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Hang on! We need her for info—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:35.04,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Are you a new member?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.27,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it and let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.79,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's for the best. You'll know soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.37,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, Raion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:44.08,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,I promise we'll be fine as long \Nas we listen to Sudocchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:44.75,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:47.08,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:48.14,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,You heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:50.28,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,Take the kid and get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:54.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,I'll deactivate my Control Right \Nonce I know you're far enough away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.23,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,M'kay then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.19,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,We're following them, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:02.21,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:03.32,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:04.61,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:07.73,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yo, where have you been \Nall this time anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:10.11,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Right, sorry about that. You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:14.27,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Catch ya later, Saneatsu. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.63,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Prime Right under the Production Attribute...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.50,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Explosion Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.26,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.67,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.10,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Wait, am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:33.09,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'm... alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.81,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Why am I alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:41.51,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I guess I never saw myself dying, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:43.09,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I must have never died?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:45.97,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,But I definitely blew up... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:48.97,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Wait, now that I think of it \NI don't remember that either...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.82,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Guess I'll never know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.03,Next Ep Title - Lower,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\pos(320,351)\c&H25FF76&}Re{\c&H29FBFB&}ac{\c&H2DBEF4&}h{\c&H1F3ADD&}e{\c&H2300D5&}d c{\c&H7B00E4&}og{\c&H961295&}ni{\c&H9D1858&}ti{\c&HEF180E&}ve {\c&HE4980F&}li{\c&HE0FF37&}mit
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.83,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Let's just assess the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.13,Flashback - Top,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.67,Flashback - Top,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,First thing's first, I need to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:05.67,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,200)\fs25\pos(325,210)}Forget That Other Stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.67,0:10:05.67,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.00,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Here, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.82,0:10:10.63,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Nice! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.73,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:13.37,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Pres?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:18.91,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,So it was Pres who helped me out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:21.13,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Sure, I suppose I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:22.52,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,H-How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:25.10,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We have plenty of time. Go ahead and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:28.83,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I actually have two Rights:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:30.82,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\pos(320,40)\c&H4A4D4A&\3c&H393D3A&\3a&HBA&}Suspension Right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:33.42,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,The Right of Suspension \Nand the Prime Right of Induction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:35.78,Comp very big-an8,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\pos(320,40)\c&H4A4D4A&\3c&H393D3A&\3a&HBA&}Induction Right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.35,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I used both of them to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:38.90,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Huh? I don't remember you having any Rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.56,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Perhaps I should explain from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.95,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,First off, the Suspension Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:49.30,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,On Day 2 of Tasuketsu, I found it when \NI was revived in the school nurse's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:51.00,georgia,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358,184)\frz340\bord0\c&H6E5445&}Right
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:51.00,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,That long ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.49,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,This Right actually turned out \Nto be very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:58.48,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It can stop certain phenomena \Nwithin designated subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:11:00.72,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Including things like time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:03.43,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,What?! That's so crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:05.02,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You'd think so, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.09,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,But this is just a Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:08.38,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,So I tested some scenarios,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:11.15,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,and found that it actually had \Nquite a few restrictions...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:15.57,georgia,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,271)\an2\bord3\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&}Activations limited to four at a time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:15.57,Flashback - Top,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Restriction #1: Activations \Nare limited to four at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:17.99,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Restriction #2: Time designations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:21.33,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I need to designate conditions \Nand set them beforehand to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.33,0:11:26.83,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Restriction #3: It only holds effect if I'm \Nwithin a one-meter radius from the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:29.71,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man... that sounds really inconveniet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.45,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:34.62,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I had an idea of how I could use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:38.68,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,but I decided not to tell you guys so \NI could focus on supporting everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.13,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,And later, I obtained \Nthe Prime Right of Induction,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:45.89,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,or the ability to physically direct \Nthe line of flow of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:50.27,Flashback - Top,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Physically direct... lines and flow...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:50.27,Black-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,230)}Physically direct lines and flow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:56.00,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what that means, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:58.95,Flashback,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,How exactly were you able to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:01.20,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I set the Suspension Right on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:06.12,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It seemed to me that you were \Nplanning on trying something reckless,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:11.43,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,so I designated the Right to activate \Nwhen your life was put in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:16.27,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,When you were engulfed in the explosion, \Nthe Suspension Right went into effect
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:19.91,Flashback,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,and everything within a one-meter radius \Nof your body stopped in time for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:23.80,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,So that's how my life was saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:25.68,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Hey, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.41,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,The Suspension Right is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.94,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Can you, like, fly with the Induction Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:32.93,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Man... this kind of treatment...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.94,Default,Kazuhiko,0,0,0,,Feels good to be back, guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:40.69,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}This spacey dude named Ippy-hiko \Ncan act as a striker-type position...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.73,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}As for the other two...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:43.66,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait a second!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:47.39,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Suspension Right can be used \Nfor four events at a time, so...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:53.74,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Cool, then let's head back \Nto our headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:56.78,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,No, we'll head somewhere \Nwe've prepared beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:13:01.63,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,We'll use Souma's Materialization Right \Nto prepare a few devices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:04.41,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Bring Eren Kunashiri and Shuji Nihonyanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.18,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,I'll tell you where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:07.83,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Shuji Nihonyanagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.23,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Nishime, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:12.56,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They must already have a plan in place...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:18.04,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Man, we were a bit lost without \Na strategist, but no worries now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:20.99,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,So then, these guys really \Nwere the ones who...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:24.89,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Yup! These guys were the brains \Nwho led us to the Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:27.25,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,and they're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.80,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,245)}Tasuketsu: Fate of the Majority
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:38.42,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Sudo Senpai, you really {\i1}were{\i0} alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.47,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:53.82,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,There's a reason why I gathered you all here, \Nbut I'm sure you have some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:55.30,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Let's get that over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.30,0:13:56.69,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Sudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:58.53,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:03.41,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That day, I'm certain I checked \Nto see if your heart stopped...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:12.29,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,To cut to the chase, I never died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.67,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yagihashi's Suspension Right \Nput me in a similar state,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.58,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,and I was waiting for \Nmy opportunity of revival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:24.40,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I set it to halt time when he came \Nface-to-face with impending death
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:27.10,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,but could still recover with 100% certainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:30.93,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,But I never knew that \Nyou had any Rights, Pres.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.11,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Well sure, I kept it a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:37.17,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I found it at school, in the nurse's \Nroom on Day 2 of Tasuketsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.17,0:14:40.28,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,But he was so prepared to die in the name \Nof defeating the Emperor that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:43.70,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,He was insistent that \NI protect myself, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:47.59,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I had a hard time finding Sudo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:52.29,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,After all, he was buried in the yard \Nof a school I'd never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:59.25,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Once I found a doctor, I deactivated \Nthe Suspension Right and had him treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:04.19,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}They make it sound so easy, \Nbut this is really advanced stuff.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:07.03,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.40,Default,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:15.26,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Huh? Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:15.98,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:17.90,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Our school is in Suginami Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.51,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Wasn't Nerima the Designated Area for Day 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:25.02,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,I thought envelopes were only placed within \Nthat day's Designated Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:26.28,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:29.16,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,They were recovered \Nby the Emperor at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:34.55,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Good thinking, but you already hold \Nthe answer to that question, Kunashiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:35.22,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:38.38,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,When and where did you get your own Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.56,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,When and where...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:45.17,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Saneatsu found the envelope on Day 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:47.38,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,which I opened on Day 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:48.72,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:53.72,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Once envelopes are obtained by someone, \Nthey can't be recovered at the time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:56.43,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,In other words, the Suspension Right \N Yagihashi obtained
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:16:00.77,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,were once obtained by someone \Nelse, and left unopened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:05.07,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,That being said, who knows if it was \Nsomething that just happened to be there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:08.82,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,or if it was placed there \Nby someone on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:12.18,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now, let's get to the main topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.41,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I want everyone to take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.82,0:16:21.08,Default,Ryuta,0,0,0,,Who is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:26.34,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,This is one of the Queen's members, \Nwhom Kazuhiko-kun and I captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:27.59,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,The Queen's?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.72,Default,Souma,0,0,0,,One of her members?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:32.05,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Wow, for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:35.49,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,He's actually suspended in time \Nright now, thanks to my Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:39.98,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,but I'm going to deactivate it so he can \Ntell us everything about their group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:41.70,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}These guys...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:44.34,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}While we were flailing around, \Nbarely getting by,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:46.83,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'd already gotten this far?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.94,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now... First up, Nishime-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:50.92,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:54.76,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to use your Priority Right \Nto prioritize Kunashiri-san's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:56.07,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:56.68,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:59.08,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,U-Um, yeah, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:02.63,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Great, so I'll just use my \NObedience Right to make him talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.63,0:17:05.12,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Actually, I'd prefer you tell him\N we have some questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:08.26,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,and that he can answer with either "yes" or "no."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.38,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.05,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Now for Jin-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:14.22,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup, I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:17.79,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Ready? Deactivate Suspension Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:23.57,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Wh-Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.65,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are they?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:28.83,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could they be the current \NEmperor's servants?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:32.10,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see... So I've been captured...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:33.26,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I'll—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.29,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:36.80,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't use my Prime Right?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.13,0:17:41.05,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I'm neutralizing your \NPrime Right... understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:44.50,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Don't pull any stunts. \NListen to us, and we'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:50.21,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,We're going to ask you some questions, \Nso answer with either "yes" or "no".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:52.06,Default,Nishime,0,0,0,,{\i1}Prioritize her order...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:54.91,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm being interrogated.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.56,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've gotta try and get by \Nwithout revealing information...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:00.58,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You understand your current \Nsituation, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.48,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:06.56,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Then, could ya answer \Nhonestly to my question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:07.52,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,N—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:20.41,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This must be... the Response Right \NLady Kisaragi was talking about!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:22.29,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's too powerful...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:24.83,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're combining multiple Rights \Nto enforce their orders!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:30.57,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you... underestimate my loyalty!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:35.05,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let... a few Rights \Nwin against my conviction!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.06,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,How impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:41.03,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,We combined three Rights under the Permission \NAttribute, and he's still able to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:44.50,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,He has incredible willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:48.97,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Not to mention, you answered \Nmy questions without hesitation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:51.46,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,but resisted here, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.02,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,You realized that was the Response Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:56.96,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,and you're aware that \Nthe Rejection Right is next...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:57.97,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.63,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,The Rejection Right is a Prime Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.36,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,There's no way to resist \Nthrough sheer will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:05.00,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,If the Rejection Right held \Nthe power to enforce responses,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.38,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,you'd know resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:10.73,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,But you resisted immediately, \Nwithout hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:14.97,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,So you already knew that the Rejection Right \Nand Response Right were separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:20.41,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,I wonder how he knows about \Nthe Rights of others so accurately...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.41,0:19:22.19,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Curious, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.02,Default,Eren,0,0,0,,Hey! What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:28.98,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Jin-kun, could you ask \Nthe same question again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.19,Default,Omi,0,0,0,,Mm-yup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:35.09,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,My Prime Right of Induction can be \Nused to control movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.20,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,His willpower is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:40.66,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Allow me to move his body \Nand make him say "no".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:46.07,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Holy crap... They gathered all that \Nfrom such a short interaction...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:49.80,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}And his method of making him \Nmove his body to say "no"...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.82,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}That must have been the plan all along.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:54.51,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Combining the Rights \Nwas just an experiment...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:59.01,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yagihashi and Sudo... What a crazy duo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.26,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,All set.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:05.39,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,So what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:07.44,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Touya Mutsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:09.10,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,What Rights do you own?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.57,0:20:14.09,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,The Prime Right of Gravity \Nand Right of Hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:16.75,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Are you one of the Queen's members?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:18.61,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:22.20,Default,Gobo,0,0,0,,Awesome! We'll be able to \Nget answers in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.52,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a dire situation...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.52,0:20:28.35,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't use my Rights, \Nnor commit suicide, nor stay silent!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:30.67,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way to avoid responding...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:34.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,The Queen's name is Kisaragi, right? \NIs she female?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.44,0:20:38.09,Default,Mutsuki,0,0,0,,Queen Kisaragi is a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:40.38,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}What to ask?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:41.55,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}The first thing is location...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:44.59,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}then it's their organizational \Nstructure and members,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:48.40,Default,Raion,0,0,0,,{\i1}every member's Rights, and \NI can't forget their motive...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:50.08,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:53.34,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,Yagihashi is asking the questions now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:55.28,Default,Sudo,0,0,0,,There's plenty of time. Don't get hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.45,0:20:59.48,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Time for the next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:01.99,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Your headquarters is in Saitama...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:04.15,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,And the Queen's name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.61,0:21:05.95,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Maria Kisaragi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:14.38,Default,Yagihashi,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.84,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,Interrogation
